content.content:
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Internal Client
    participant API as HoJ Distribution API
    participant Brand as Brand Site (weebora.com)
    participant Stripe

    Client->>API: POST /v1/itineraries?brand=weebora.com (productId, startDate, adults, rooms)
    API->>Brand: POST /it/api/itinerary
    Brand-->>API: { data: { itineraryId } }
    API-->>Client: { data: { itineraryId } }

    Client->>API: GET /v1/itineraries/{id}/activities?startDate=...
    API->>Brand: GET /it/api/itinerary/{id}/activity/list
    Brand-->>API: { data: Activity[] }
    API-->>Client: { data: Activity[] }
    Note over Client,API: Same proxy pattern for accommodations, customer, pax, promo, currency.

    Client->>API: POST /v1/itineraries/{id}/payment { paymentType }
    API->>Brand: POST /it/api/itinerary/{id}/payment { paymentType }
    Brand-->>API: { data: stripe_client_secret }
    API-->>Client: { data: stripe_client_secret }
    Client->>Stripe: confirmCardPayment(stripe_client_secret) (frontend)

    Client->>API: POST /v1/bookings { itineraryId, paymentType }
    API->>Brand: POST /it/api/booking { itineraryId, paymentType }
    Brand-->>API: { data: reservationCode }
    API-->>Client: { data: reservationCode }
-----
>> Stripe confirms the payment : 02 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">8. Thank-you — confirm booking</span></h2> <span data-as="p">After Stripe confirms the payment confirm the reservation with the <strong>same</strong> <code>paymentType</code> (and <code>planIndex</code> when using a plan . If you omit <code>paymentType</code> the API defaults to <code>&quot;full&quot;</code> before forwarding to the brand — a body of only <code> &quot;itineraryId&quot; </code> is enough for a full payment.</span> <div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark bg-transparent da

