>> upsert : C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Operational notes</span></h2> <ul> <li><strong>Idempotency</strong>: brand-site <code>POST /booking</code> is an <em>upsert</em> keyed by <code>itineraryId</code> — calling it twice after a successful payment is safe and returns the same reservation code.</li> <li><strong>Payment types</strong>: the brand validator only accepts <code>paymentType</code> <code>&quot;full&quot;</code> | <code>&quot;plan&quot;</code>. Deposit / balance is <code>plan</code> + <code>planIndex</code>. The API defaults omitted <code>paymentType</code> to <code>&quot;full&quot;</code> on both payment and booking so a documented <code> &quot;itineraryId&quot; </code> body still works.</li> <li><strong>Timeouts</strong>: default 15s pe
